    21,                       !- Day of Month
    SummerDesignDay,          !- Day Type
    35.1,                     !- Maximum DryBulb Temperature
    13.5,                     !- Daily DryBulb Temperature Range
    DefaultMultipliers,       !- DryBulb Temperature Range Modifier Type
    ,                         !- DryBulb Temperature Range Modifier Day Schedule Name
    Wetbulb,                  !- Humidity Condition Type
    15.7,                     !- Wetbulb or DewPoint at Maximum DryBulb
